# General Rules

- fix markdown error/warnings with ide:getDiagnostics (MCP) or whatever you need
- before commit, test/format/lint not to fail CI.
- before playwright test, confirm user did `make dev`
- format/lin mdc file except for header section surrounded by --- lines
- thinkharder your change should always answer to requirements on the ticket. Do plan and implement then  │
│   test and check. 